  cookingInstructions:
  - Chop the grilled pork jowl into minced
  - Chop the onion into minced
  - Chop the calamansi to sliced
  - Chop green chillie into sliced
  - Chop the birds eye chillies into sliced
  - Chop the chicken liver to sliced
  - Turn on the Stove to high heat
  - Put the wok in the stove
  - 'Add 1 tsp of cooking oil '
  - Add Chiken Liver
  - Saute it using the spatula
  - Add chop grilled pork jowl
  - Add chop onion
  - Add green chillie
  - Add birds eye chillies
  - Mix using the spatula
  - Add the calamansi to squeeze the juice
  - Add 1/2 tsp of vinegar
  - Add 1 tsp of soy sauce
  - Add 1 tsp of fish sauce
  - Mix using the spatula
